          "queryType": "timeseries",
          "rawSql": "SELECT timestamp AS time, algorithm, baseline, lower, upper\nFROM evaluations FINAL\nWHERE machine_id = ${machine_id:singlequote}\n  AND metric_name = ${metric_name:singlequote}\n  AND $__timeFilter(timestamp)\nORDER BY time",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Samples (green), anomaly flags per algorithm, and the baseline and band of each detector."
